      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Thick vines spread through the ground and explode into spines, dealing magic damage to enemies within the area. If cast near a seed, Deadly Spines grows a Thorn Spitter plant, which fires at enemies from afar.",
      "summary_zh": "浓密的藤蔓在地面蔓延，并爆炸成棘刺，对范围内的敌人造成魔法伤害。如果在一颗种子附近施放，那么【Q致命棘刺】就会让种子长成一株荆棘喷射者，可对远处的敌人进行攻击。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
