      "summary_en": "Zyra sends forth vines through the ground to ensnare her target, dealing damage and rooting enemies they come across. If cast near a seed, Grasping Roots grows a Vine Lasher, whose short range attacks reduce enemy Move Speed.",
      "summary_zh": "婕拉朝前方放出贯穿地面的藤蔓来诱捕她的目标，藤蔓经过的敌人会受到伤害和束缚效果。如果在一颗种子附近施放，那么【E缠绕之根】就会让种子长成一株藤蔓鞭击者，可进行短程攻击并降低敌人的移动速度。",
